review.mp4: 10 s, 640x360, H.264 with a key frame every second, AAC audio.
Made with:

ffmpeg -y -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=640x360:rate=30:duration=10 -f lavfi -i sine=frequency=440:duration=10 -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 36 -g 30 -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -b:a 48k -shortest -movflags +faststart review.mp4

deaths.mp4: 60 s, 640x360, 24 fps, for the death review scenes.
Made with:

ffmpeg -y -f lavfi -i testsrc=size=640x360:rate=24:duration=60 -f lavfi -i sine=frequency=330:duration=60 -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 40 -g 24 -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -b:a 24k -shortest -movflags +faststart deaths.mp4

storyboard.json and storyboard-0.jpg: the seek bar preview sheet of review.mp4 (11 tiles, one per second, 160x90).
Made with: greyscreen-cli storyboard <a folder whose game.json names review.mp4 with duration_secs 10>
